WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.763
Welcome.

2
00:00:00.763 --> 00:00:04.224
This is the technical deep
dive for HR-Driven Identity,

3
00:00:04.224 --> 00:00:07.762
one of the books of the
Federal Modernization Workbook.

4
00:00:07.762 --> 00:00:10.498
It's for the people
who'll actually build it:

5
00:00:10.498 --> 00:00:14.875
identity engineers, HR systems
integrators and ICAM architects.

6
00:00:14.875 --> 00:00:19.300
The short briefing makes the case for
letting the personnel record drive identity.

7
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:21.200
This session goes underneath it.

8
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:26.022
Part 1 is the data and the pipe: who
owns each fact, how a person is keyed,

9
00:00:26.022 --> 00:00:31.360
and how records move from the new
government-wide HR platform into Entra ID.

10
00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:36.612
Part 2 is lifecycle, access and evidence,
and the plan that ties it together.

11
00:00:36.612 --> 00:00:39.580
First, where this session
sits in the series.
